pico-8 cartridge // http://www.pico-8.com
version 42
__lua__
this game is about a firefighting
pengiun.
you get called out to various
situations and have to choose
which appartus to bring.
then you drive to the scene,
if you crash you lose.
then when you arrive on scene,
you do scene size up,
call for additional resources
with x button.
y0u have to choose which hose
to deploy,
e.g. cross-lay, bumper line,
2.5in off the hose bed.
the series of calls are like
levels, if you make the right
choice of appartus & technique,
you can put the fire out and move on.
there isn't necessarily a right
appartus, but sometimes a wrong
one.
you can add various options like
a piercing nozzle,
whether to vent the roof,
whether a ladder truck is on scene.
the home dept is a rural department
in shutesbury, ma
with a rescue truck,
2 engines with 1000 and 2000 gallons,
and 2 brush trucks.
you get a various number of responders
to work with for each situation.
of course,
the responders are all penguins,
i guess.
the fire fighting part can jump
into an interactive where you 
actually fight it.
i'm thinking of how like oregon
trail goes into the hunting mode.
brush fires of different size,
car fire,
barn and real structure fires are the
call types: like what a rural
department would see.

